### Variáveis locais (REST Client)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5070/api
@token = substitua-pelo-jwt
@idempotencyKey = smoke-ciclo-comercial-001

### Pesquisa paginada de pedidos
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales-orders/search?search=cliente&limit=100&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Relatório completo com os mesmos filtros
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales-orders/report?search=cliente&status=ANALISADO
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar RMA vinculado ao chamado
POST {{baseUrl}}/technical-assistance/calls/1/rmas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}

{
  "reason": "Produto apresentou falha durante a garantia",
  "sla_due_at": "2026-09-05T18:00:00-03:00",
  "items": [
    {
      "call_line_code": 1,
      "quantity": "1",
      "serial_number": "SERIE-001",
      "lot_number": "LOTE-001"
    }
  ]
}

### Consultar RMA no tenant autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}/technical-assistance/rmas/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Transicionar RMA
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/technical-assistance/rmas/1/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "AUTORIZADO",
  "authorization_number": "AUT-001",
  "reason": "Elegibilidade confirmada"
}

### Enviar evidência do RMA (form-data: file)
POST {{baseUrl}}/technical-assistance/rmas/1/evidences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=RMAEvidence

--RMAEvidence
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="evidencia.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./evidencia.pdf
--RMAEvidence--

### Pesquisar evidências do RMA
GET {{baseUrl}}/technical-assistance/rmas/1/evidences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Configurar competência da comissão
PUT {{baseUrl}}/commercial-commissions/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "competence_event": "RATEIO",
  "invoice_share_pct": "50",
  "receipt_share_pct": "50"
}

### Conciliar comissão
POST {{baseUrl}}/commercial-commissions/ledger/1/CONCILIADA
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: commission-reconcile-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"Documentos fiscais e recebimentos conferidos"}

### Pagar comissão
POST {{baseUrl}}/commercial-commissions/ledger/1/PAGA
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: commission-payment-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"Pagamento autorizado","payment_reference":"PAG-001"}

### Cancelar recorrência com data efetiva e política futura
POST {{baseUrl}}/recurring-sales/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Encerramento contratual solicitado pelo cliente",
  "effective_date": "2026-08-31",
  "future_orders_policy": "CANCELAR_NAO_FATURADOS",
  "correlation_id": "cancel-contract-001"
}
